# Base URL the frontend uses for API calls. Defaults to `/api` (relative) if unset, which
# works with the Vite dev proxy locally and any same-origin production deployment (see
# docs/deployment.md). Only set this to an absolute URL for a cross-origin deployment — the
# API has no CORS headers yet, so that won't work until a future spec adds them.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
